  "description": "AsiBackbone 7.5.2 is a backward-compatible dependency maintenance patch for the Accountable Systems Infrastructure package family for .NET. It updates Microsoft dependency versions, Aspire sample hosting, and FsCheck test tooling while preserving public APIs, durable schemas, canonical wire values, package IDs, the net10.0 target, and AssemblyVersion 7.0.0.0.",
